  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供 WebSocket 客户端与服务端能力。客户端支持连接/断开、消息收发、二进制数据、自动重连、心跳检测；服务端支持监听端口、广播消息、管理客户端连接。",
    "en-US": "WebSocket client and server module. Client supports connect/disconnect, messaging, binary data, auto-reconnect, heartbeat. Server supports listening, broadcasting, and client management."
  },
